**How we'll use your climate data:**

This information is sent to the **HarvestSage™** AI, which calculates the required specifications for your modules. It will determine the optimal **PureLight™** panel thickness and pre-configure the **PrecisionHeat™** system to maintain perfect root-zone temperatures, protecting your plants from extremes and optimizing energy use automatically.

